": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.14996114996114995, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.16006216006216006}, {"text": "Answer the question on pages 16-24 of the Paper | Writing Booklet. Extra writing booklets", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.18337218337218336, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.19658119658119658}, {"text": "are available.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.20046620046620048, "x1": 0.22527472527472528, "y1": 0.21056721056721056}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.5274725274725275, "y1": 0.24397824397824397}, {"text": "m= demonstrate understanding of the concept of discovery in the context of your study", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2501942501942502, "x1": 0.8406593406593407, "y1": 0.2634032634032634}, {"text": "\u2122 analyse, explain and assess the ways discovery is represented in a variety of texts", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2703962703962704, "x1": 0.8263736263736263, "y1": 0.2836052836052836}, {"text": "organise, develop and express ideas using language appropriate to audience, purpose", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.2905982905982906, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.3038073038073038}, {"text": "and context", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.3076923076923077, "x1": 0.26043956043956046, "y1": 0.317016317016317}, {"text": "Question 3 (15 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.35275835275835277, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.3651903651903652}, {"text": "The process of discovery involves uncovering what is hidden and reconsidering what is known.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.3861693861693862, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.39937839937839936}, {"text": "How is this perspective on discovery explored in your prescribed text and ONE other related", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4195804195804196, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.43278943278943277}, {"text": "text of your own choosing?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4358974358974359, "x1": 0.34065934065934067, "y1": 0.4491064491064491}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are listed on the next page.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.4700854700854701, "x1": 0.5065934065934066, "y1": 0.4825174825174825}, {"text": "Question 3 continues on page 11", "x0": 0.36153846153846153, "y0": 0.5361305361305362, "x1": 0.6373626373626373, "y1": 0.5493395493395493}, {"text": "\u201410-", "x0": 0.4736263736263736, "y0": 0.9440559440559441, "x1": 0.5252747252747253, "y1": 0.9533799533799534}], [{"text": "Question 3 (continued)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.11266511266511267, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.1250971250971251}, {"text": "Prose Fiction", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.13364413364413363, "x1": 0.256043956043956, "y1": 0.14374514374514374}, {"text": "James Bradley, Wrack", "x0": 0.33406593406593404, "y0": 0.13364413364413363, "x1": 0.5142857142857142, "y1": 0.14685314685314685}, {"text": "Kate Chopin, The Awakening", "x0": 0.33406593406593404, "y0": 0.1554001554001554, "x1": 0.5714285714285714, "y1": 0.16783216783216784}, {"text": "Tara June Winch, Swallow the Air", "x0": 0.33296703296703295, "y0": 0.17637917637917638, "x1": 0.6120879120879121, "y1": 0.18803418803418803}, {"text": "Nonfiction", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.19735819735819735, "x1": 0.23296703296703297, "y1": 0.20745920745920746}, {"text": "Bill Bryson, A Short History of Nearly Everything", "x0": 0.33406593406593404, "y0": 0.19735819735819735, "x1": 0.7395604395604396, "y1": 0.21056721056721056}, {"text": "Ernesto \u2018Che\u2019 Guevara, The Moto: \u2018le Diaries", "x0": 0.33406593406593404, "y0": 0.2191142191142191, "x1": 0.7230769230769231, "y1": 0.23076923076923078}, {"text": "Drama", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.2400932400932401, "x1": 0.2021978021978022, "y1": 0.2501942501942502}, {"text": "Mi